damaged_code:
```c
// Main loop matching active threads
for_each_thread(t) {
    // BUG: Assuming t is alive. t may have exited and its ID
    // is already reassigned to an unrelated thread.
    status_hist[t->status]++; 
}
```

fix:
Acquire an exclusive lock that prevents threads from registering or departing during the check.
```c
acquire_lock(&departing_thread_lock);
for_each_thread(t) {
    status_hist[t->status]++;
}
release_lock(&departing_thread_lock);
```
